  "historyNote": "#6675, eff 1-27-98; renumbered by #6853 (formerly Rev 304.09), EXPIRED: 1-27-06 New. #8709, eff 8-25-06; ss by #10758, eff 1-16-15; ss by #13177, eff 3-6-21; ss by #13450, eff 9-23-22; ss by #13943-B, eff 4-27-24; ss by #14231, eff 4-3-25 (formerly Rev 304.10), EXPIRES 4-3-35",
